# The defect #4966 fixed: the rule count was derived from the failure breakdown.
MODULE: RuleCountIsPolicyRulesCountsReasons
TARGET: RuleCountIsPolicyRules
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the report's rule count is the number of failure reasons (#4966)
PERTURBS: Finish

--- FIND
    /\ repRuleCount' = RuleCount(scanPolicy)
--- REPLACE
    /\ repRuleCount' = FailureReasons
--- END
